            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwaka uheze, ingabo z’i Siriya ziza gutera Yowashi; zitera i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, bica abakuru baho bose. Barungikira umwami wabo i Damasiko ivyo basahuye vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho ingabo z’Abasiriya zari zaje ari nke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " agabura mu maboko yabo ingabo zibasumvya ubwinshi z’Abayuda. Kubera ko Abayuda bari barahevye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana ya ba sekuruza, ni co catumye urubanza Imana yaciriye Yowashi rumushikako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo Basiriya bagiye, basize Yowashi yakomeretse cane. Abakuru bakora i bwami bagira inama yo kumwica kuko yishe mwene Yehoyada umuherezi, baca bamutsinda mu buriri aho yari aryamye. Nuko arapfa, ahambwa mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, ariko ntibamuhamba mu mva z’abami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
