          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamugiriye inama bari Zabadi, umuhungu w’umugore yitwa Shimeyati w’Umwamonikazi, hamwe na Yehozabadi, umuhungu w’umugore yitwa Shimurite w’Umunyamowabukazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkuru z’abahungu ba Yowashi, ivyavugishijwe vyinshi kuri we, n’ivyerekeye isanurwa ry’Ingoro y’Imana vyose vyanditswe mu gitabu c’abami. Maze Amaziya umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma, aba umwami mu gishingo ciwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
